## Agent habits

- **Verify “next” against code** before implementing — docs lag (R0.5, Time 8a, R2 tallies were common false gaps)
- Prefer extending memory adapters + APIs first; Postgres flip is ops
- Three reminder/email surfaces stay separate (public invite vs Hub copy draft vs SMTP) — see ground-truth doc
- Gate write CTAs by role; steward mobile read-only via `useStewardReadOnly`
- Update `docs/PROGRESS.md` + module specs + relevant `.cursor/rules` when closing a milestone
- Before large commits: `npm run lint` + `npm run test:unit` (smoke when UI/routes change)
